---
// "The board doesn't exist yet": the interactive mountain builder.
import MountainBuilder from '../MountainBuilder.astro';
---
<section class="section" id="play">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2>The board doesn’t exist yet</h2>
      <p class="lede">
        Every game starts with empty frames, laid out in any shape the table likes. Turn by turn, climbers draw
        sculpted terrain tiles from four bags and clip them in, so every expedition climbs a mountain nobody has
        seen before.
      </p>
      <p>Pick a mountain, or shuffle a new one from the frames in the box, then draw tiles from the bags.</p>
    </div>
    <MountainBuilder />
  </div>
</section>
